      "summaries": {
        "en": "Self-Hosting Guide is a curated collection of resources for locally hosting software, covering everything from cloud alternatives and LLMs to home automation and networking. It excels as a structured, opinionated list that teaches you not just tools but the principles of self-sufficiency and privacy. Use it as a roadmap to set up your own services with Docker, WireGuard, or Home Assistant, and gain control over your digital life.",
        "zh": "Self-Hosting Guide 是一份精心策划的资源集合，教你如何在自己的硬件或私有服务器上托管软件，涵盖云替代方案、大语言模型、家庭自动化、网络等主题。它的独特之处在于不仅列出工具，还通过结构化分类和实用建议传授自托管的设计原则——比如用 Docker 简化部署、用 WireGuard 保障安全连接。你可以把它当作路线图，从搭建 Home Assistant 智能家居开始，逐步替换 Google Drive、ChatGPT 等云服务，真正掌控自己的数据与隐私。",
        "es": "Self-Hosting Guide is a curated collection of resources for locally hosting software, covering everything from cloud alternatives and LLMs to home automation and networking. It excels as a structured, opinionated list that teaches you not just tools but the principles of self-sufficiency and privacy. Use it as a roadmap to set up your own services with Docker, WireGuard, or Home Assistant, and gain control over your digital life.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "Self-Hosting-Guide stands out for authentication, awesome, and awesome-list in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Self-Hosting Guide is a curated collection of resources for locally hosting software, covering everything from cloud alternatives and LLMs to home automation and networking. It excels as a structured, opinionated list that teaches you not just tools but the principles of self-sufficiency and privacy. Use it as a roadmap to set up your own services with Docker, WireGuard, or Home Assistant, and gain control over your digital life.",
