      "summaries": {
        "en": "Qwen3-VL-32B-Instruct is a multimodal AI model that understands both images and text, enabling visual question answering and document analysis. Its key innovation is a dynamic resolution mechanism that adapts input image sizes to preserve fine details, improving OCR and object recognition. You can deploy it via Hugging Face Transformers for tasks like image captioning, visual QA, or building conversational agents that see. The Apache 2.0 license allows flexible use in research and commercial applications.",
        "zh": "Qwen3-VL-32B-Instruct 是一个同时理解图像和文本的多模态AI模型，专为视觉问答、文档分析等任务设计。其核心技术亮点是动态分辨率机制：模型会根据输入图像自动调整处理粒度，保留微小文字和物体细节，显著提升OCR和细粒度识别能力。你可以通过Hugging Face Transformers库快速部署，用于图像描述、基于图片的对话系统或自动化文档信息提取。该模型采用Apache 2.0许可证，支持研究及商业用途。试试用它分析一张复杂图表或手写笔记，感受多模态推理的潜力。",
        "es": "Qwen3-VL-32B-Instruct is a multimodal AI model that understands both images and text, enabling visual question answering and document analysis. Its key innovation is a dynamic resolution mechanism that adapts input image sizes to preserve fine details, improving OCR and object recognition. You can deploy it via Hugging Face Transformers for tasks like image captioning, visual QA, or building conversational agents that see. The Apache 2.0 license allows flexible use in research and commercial applications.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "Qwen3-VL-32B-Instruct stands out for transformers, safetensors, and qwen3_vl in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Qwen3-VL-32B-Instruct is a multimodal AI model that understands both images and text, enabling visual question answering and document analysis. Its key innovation is a dynamic resolution mechanism that adapts input image sizes to preserve fine details, improving OCR and object recognition. You can deploy it via Hugging Face Transformers for tasks like image captioning, visual QA, or building conversational agents that see. The Apache 2.0 license allows flexible use in research and commercial applications.",
          "how": "Review https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-VL-32B-Instruct for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
